{"route":"/docs/4.1/components/modal/","version":"4.1","renderedVersion":"4.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Modal","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use Bootstrap’s JavaScript modal plugin to add dialogs to your site for lightboxes, user notifications, or completely custom content."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Before getting started with Bootstrap’s modal component, be sure to read the following as our menu options have recently changed."},{"id":"how-it-works--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-1","type":"item","en":"Modals are built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. They’re positioned over everything else in the document and remove scroll from the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> so that modal content scrolls instead."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-2","type":"item","en":"Clicking on the modal “backdrop” will automatically close the modal."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-3","type":"item","en":"Bootstrap only supports one modal window at a time. Nested modals aren’t supported as we believe them to be poor user experiences."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-4","type":"item","en":"Modals use <code>position: fixed</code>, which can sometimes be a bit particular about its rendering. Whenever possible, place your modal HTML in a top-level position to avoid potential interference from other elements. You’ll likely run into issues when nesting a <code>.modal</code> within another fixed element."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-5","type":"item","en":"Once again, due to <code>position: fixed</code>, there are some caveats with using modals on mobile devices. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/browsers-devices/#modals-and-dropdowns-on-mobile\">See our browser support docs</a> for details."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-6","type":"item","en":"Due to how HTML5 defines its semantics, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input#attr-autofocus\">the <code>autofocus</code> HTML attribute</a> has no effect in Bootstrap modals. To achieve the same effect, use some custom JavaScript:"}]}]},{"id":"how-it-works--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').on('shown.bs.modal', function () {\n  $('#myInput').trigger('focus')\n})","language":"js"},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Keep reading for demos and usage guidelines."},{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"modal-components","type":"heading","en":"Modal components","level":3},{"id":"modal-components--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Below is a <em>static</em> modal example (meaning its <code>position</code> and <code>display</code> have been overridden). Included are the modal header, modal body (required for <code>padding</code>), and modal footer (optional). We ask that you include modal headers with dismiss actions whenever possible, or provide another explicit dismiss action."},{"id":"modal-components--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d452bb87ea9461b139bf","height":147},{"id":"modal-components--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"modal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h5 class=\"modal-title\">Modal title</h5>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <p>Modal body text goes here.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save changes</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"live-demo","type":"heading","en":"Live demo","level":3},{"id":"live-demo--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggle a working modal demo by clicking the button below. It will slide down and fade in from the top of the page."},{"id":"exampleModalLiveLabel","type":"heading","en":"Modal title","level":5,"anchors":["exampleModalLive"]},{"id":"exampleModalLiveLabel--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Woohoo, you&#39;re reading this text in a modal!"},{"id":"exampleModalLiveLabel--caption-1","type":"caption","en":"Close"},{"id":"exampleModalLiveLabel--caption-2","type":"caption","en":"Save changes"},{"id":"exampleModalLiveLabel--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fc75cd4dd641822ee131","height":147},{"id":"exampleModalLiveLabel--code-1","type":"code","value":"<!-- Button trigger modal -->\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModal\">\n  Launch demo modal\n</button>\n\n<!-- Modal -->\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"exampleModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"exampleModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h5 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"exampleModalLabel\">Modal title</h5>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        ...\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save changes</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"scrolling-long-content","type":"heading","en":"Scrolling long content","level":3},{"id":"scrolling-long-content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"When modals become too long for the user’s viewport or device, they scroll independent of the page itself. Try the demo below to see what we mean."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle","type":"heading","en":"Modal title","level":5,"anchors":["exampleModalLong"]},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. Cras justo odio, dapibus ac facilisis in, egestas eget quam. Morbi leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Vivamus sagittis lacus vel augue laoreet rutrum faucibus dolor auctor."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Aenean lacinia bibendum nulla sed consectetur. Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Donec sed odio dui. Donec ullamcorper nulla non metus auctor fringilla."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. Cras justo odio, dapibus ac facilisis in, egestas eget quam. Morbi leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Vivamus sagittis lacus vel augue laoreet rutrum faucibus dolor auctor."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"Aenean lacinia bibendum nulla sed consectetur. Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Donec sed odio dui. Donec ullamcorper nulla non metus auctor fringilla."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. Cras justo odio, dapibus ac facilisis in, egestas eget quam. Morbi leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros."},{"