entum. Cras justo odio, dapibus ac facilisis in, egestas eget quam. Morbi leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Vivamus sagittis lacus vel augue laoreet rutrum faucibus dolor auctor."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"Aenean lacinia bibendum nulla sed consectetur. Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Donec sed odio dui. Donec ullamcorper nulla non metus auctor fringilla."},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--caption-1","type":"caption","en":"Close"},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--caption-2","type":"caption","en":"Save changes"},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7ca0430614c6d35f0fe0","height":147},{"id":"exampleModalLongTitle--code-1","type":"code","value":"<!-- Button trigger modal -->\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModalLong\">\n  Launch demo modal\n</button>\n\n<!-- Modal -->\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"exampleModalLong\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"exampleModalLongTitle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h5 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"exampleModalLongTitle\">Modal title</h5>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        ...\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save changes</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"vertically-centered","type":"heading","en":"Vertically centered","level":3},{"id":"vertically-centered--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.modal-dialog-centered</code> to <code>.modal-dialog</code> to vertically center the modal."},{"id":"exampleModalCenterTitle","type":"heading","en":"Modal title","level":5,"anchors":["exampleModalCenter"]},{"id":"exampleModalCenterTitle--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. Cras justo odio, dapibus ac facilisis in, egestas eget quam. Morbi leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros."},{"id":"exampleModalCenterTitle--caption-1","type":"caption","en":"Close"},{"id":"exampleModalCenterTitle--caption-2","type":"caption","en":"Save changes"},{"id":"exampleModalCenterTitle--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fb7d9e8f69c92527e237","height":147},{"id":"exampleModalCenterTitle--code-1","type":"code","value":"<!-- Button trigger modal -->\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModalCenter\">\n  Launch demo modal\n</button>\n\n<!-- Modal -->\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"exampleModalCenter\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"exampleModalCenterTitle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h5 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"exampleModalCenterTitle\">Modal title</h5>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        ...\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save changes</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"tooltips-and-popovers","type":"heading","en":"Tooltips and popovers","level":3},{"id":"tooltips-and-popovers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/components/tooltips/\">Tooltips</a> and <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/components/popovers/\">popovers</a> can be placed within modals as needed. When modals are closed, any tooltips and popovers within are also automatically dismissed."},{"id":"exampleModalPopoversLabel","type":"heading","en":"Modal title","level":5,"anchors":["exampleModalPopovers"]},{"id":"popover-in-a-modal","type":"heading","en":"Popover in a modal","level":5},{"id":"popover-in-a-modal--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"This <a href=\"#\">button</a> triggers a popover on click."},{"id":"tooltips-in-a-modal","type":"heading","en":"Tooltips in a modal","level":5},{"id":"tooltips-in-a-modal--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"#\">This link</a> and <a href=\"#\">that link</a> have tooltips on hover."},{"id":"tooltips-in-a-modal--caption-1","type":"caption","en":"Close"},{"id":"tooltips-in-a-modal--caption-2","type":"caption","en":"Save changes"},{"id":"tooltips-in-a-modal--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d39810786bc08db3551a","height":147},{"id":"tooltips-in-a-modal--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"modal-body\">\n  <h5>Popover in a modal</h5>\n  <p>This <a href=\"#\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary popover-test\" title=\"Popover title\" data-content=\"Popover body content is set in this attribute.\">button</a> triggers a popover on click.</p>\n  <hr>\n  <h5>Tooltips in a modal</h5>\n  <p><a href=\"#\" class=\"tooltip-test\" title=\"Tooltip\">This link</a> and <a href=\"#\" class=\"tooltip-test\" title=\"Tooltip\">that link</a> have tooltips on hover.</p>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"using-the-grid","type":"heading","en":"Using the grid","level":3},{"id":"using-the-grid--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Utilize the Bootstrap grid system within a modal by nesting <code>.container-fluid</code> within the <code>.modal-body</code>. Then, use the normal grid system classes as you would anywhere else."},{"id":"gridModalLabel","type":"heading","en":"Grids in modals","level":5,"anchors":["gridSystemModal"]},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":".col-md-4"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":".col-md-4 .ml-auto"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".col-md-3 .ml-auto"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".col-md-2 .ml-auto"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":".col-md-6 .ml-auto"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"Level 1: .col-sm-9"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"Level 2: .col-8 .col-sm-6"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"Level 2: .col-4 .col-sm-6"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--caption-1","type":"caption","en":"Close"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--caption-2","type":"caption","en":"Save changes"},{"id":"gridModalLabel--example-1","type":"demo","key":"15ab0bd4404c12df21ca","height":147},{"id":"gridModalLabel--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"modal-body\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">.col-md-4</div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4 ml-auto\">.col-md-4 .ml-auto</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-3 ml-auto\">.col-md-3 .ml-auto</div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-2 ml-auto\">.col-md-2 .ml-auto</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-6 ml-auto\">.col-md-6 .ml-auto</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n        Level 1: .col-sm-9\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"col-8 col-sm-6\">\n            Level 2: .col-8 .col-sm-6\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col-4 col-sm-6\">\n            Level 2: .col-4 .col-sm-6\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"varying-modal-content","type":"heading","en":"Varying modal content","level":3},{"id":"varying-modal-content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Have a bunch of buttons that all trigger the same modal with slightly different contents? Use <code>event.relatedTarget</code> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/HTML/Howto/Use_data_attributes\">HTML <code>data-*</code> attributes</a> (possibly <a href=\"https://api.jquery.com/data/\">via jQuery</a>) to vary the contents of the modal depending on which button was clicked."},{"id":"varying-modal-content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Below is a live demo followed by example HTML and JavaScript. For more information, <a href=\"#events\">read the modal events docs</a> for details on <code>relatedTarget</code>."},{"id":"varying-modal-content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3d6ec5030f79dd14d9ce","height":300,"anchors":["exampleModal","exampleModalLabel","recipient-name","message-text"]},{"id":"varying-modal-content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModal\" data-whatever=\"@mdo\">Open modal for @mdo</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModal\" data-whatever=\"@fat\">Open modal for @fat</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModal\" data-whatever=\"@getbootstrap\">Open modal for @getbootstrap</button>\n\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"exampleModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"exampleModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h5 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"exampleModalLabel\">New message</h5>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <form>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"recipient-name\" class=\"col-form-label\">Recipient:</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"recipient-name\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"message-text\" class=\"col-form-label\">Message:</label>\n            <textarea class=\"form-control\" id=\"message-text\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Send message</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"varying-modal-content--code-2","type":"code","value":"$('#exampleModal').on('show.bs.modal', function (event) {\n  var button = $(event.relatedTarget) // Button that triggered the modal\n  var recipient = button.data('whatever') // Extract info from data-* attributes\n  // If necessary, you could initiate an AJAX request here (and then do the updating in a callback).\n  // Update the modal's content. We'll use jQuery here, but you could use a data binding library or other methods instead.\n  var modal = $(this)\n  modal.find('.modal-title').text('New message to ' + recipient)\n  modal.find('.modal-body input').val(recipient)\n})","language":"js"},{"id":"remove-animation","type":"heading","en":"Remove animation","level":3},{"id":"remove-animation--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"For modals that simply appear rather than fade in to view, remove the <code>.fade</code> class from your modal markup."},{"id":"remove-animation--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"modal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"...\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  ...\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"dynamic-heights","type":"heading","en":"Dynamic heights","level":3},{"id":"dynamic-heights--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If the height of a modal changes while it is open, you should call <code>$(&#39;#myModal&#39;).modal(&#39;handleUpdate&#39;)</code> to readjust the modal’s position in case a scrollbar appears."},{"id":"accessibility","type":"heading","en":"Accessibility","level":3},{"id":"accessibility--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Be sure to add <code>role=&quot;dialog&quot;</code> and <code>aria-labelledby=&quot;...&quot;</code>, referencing the modal title, to <code>.modal</code>, and <code>role=&quot;document&quot;</code> to the <code>.modal-dialog</code> itself. Additionally, you may give a description of your modal dialog with <code>aria-describedby</code> on <code>.modal</code>."},{"id":"embedding-youtube-videos","type":"heading","en":"Embedding YouTube videos","level":3},{"id":"embedding-youtube-videos--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Embedding YouTube videos in modals requires additional JavaScript not in Bootstrap to automatically stop playback and more. <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/18622508/bootstrap-3-and-youtube-in-modal\">See this helpful Stack Overflow post</a> for more information."},{"id":"optional-sizes","type":"heading","en":"Optional sizes","level":2},{"id":"optional-sizes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Modals have two optional sizes, available via modifier classes to be placed on a <code>.modal-dialog</code>. These sizes kick in at certain breakpoints to avoid horizontal scrollbars on narrower viewports."},{"id":"optional-sizes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"036c830f29cc7188d37d","height":174},{"id":"optional-sizes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<!-- Large modal -->\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\".bd-example-modal-lg\">Large modal</button>\n\n<div class=\"modal fade bd-example-modal-lg\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"myLargeModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      ...\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Small modal -->\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\".bd-example-modal-sm\">Small modal</button>\n\n<div class=\"modal fade bd-example-modal-sm\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"mySmallModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-sm\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      ...\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"myLargeModalLabel","type":"heading","en":"Large modal","level":5},{"id":"mySmallModalLabel","type":"heading","en":"Small modal","level":5},{"id":"usage","type":"heading","en":"Usage","level":2},{"id":"usage--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The modal plugin toggles your hidden content on demand, via data attributes or JavaScript. It also adds <code>.modal-open</code> to the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> to override default scrolling behavior and generates a <code>.modal-backdrop</code> to provide a click area for dismissing shown modals when clicking outside the modal."},{"id":"via-data-attributes","type":"heading","en":"Via data attributes","level":3},{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Activate a modal without writing JavaScript. Set <code>data-toggle=&quot;modal&quot;</code> on a controller element, like a button, along with a <code>data-target=&quot;#foo&quot;</code> or <code>href=&quot;#foo&quot;</code> to target a specific modal to toggle."},{"id":"via-data-attributes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#myModal\">Launch modal</button>","language":"html"},{"id":"via-javascript","type":"heading","en":"Via JavaScript","level":3},{"id":"via-javascript--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Call a modal with id <code>myModal</code> with a single line of JavaScript:"},{"id":"via-javascript--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').modal(options)","language":"js"},{"id":"options","type":"heading","en":"Options","level":3},{"id":"options--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Options can be passed via data attributes or JavaScript. For data attributes, append the option name to <code>data-</code>, as in <code>data-backdrop=&quot;&quot;</code>."},{"id":"options--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Name"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Default"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"backdrop"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"boolean or the string <code>&#39;static&#39;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"true"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"Includes a modal-backdrop element. Alternatively, specify <code>static</code> for a backdrop which doesn&#39;t close the modal on click."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"keyboard"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"boolean"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"true"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"Closes the modal when escape key is pressed"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"focus"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"boolean"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"true"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"Puts the focus on the modal when initialized."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"show"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":"boolean"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-20","type":"paragraph","en":"true"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-21","type":"paragraph","en":"Shows the modal when initialized."}]}]}]},{"id":"methods","type":"heading","en":"Methods","level":3},{"id":"methods--note-1","type":"note","tone":"danger","body":[{"id":"asynchronous-methods-and-transitions","type":"heading","en":"Asynchronous methods and transitions","level":4},{"id":"asynchronous-methods-and-transitions--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"All API methods are <strong>asynchronous</strong> and start a <strong>transition</strong>. They return to the caller as soon as the transition is started but <strong>before it ends</strong>. In addition, a method call on a <strong>transitioning component will be ignored</strong>."},{"id":"asynchronous-methods-and-transitions--note-text-2","type":"note-text","en":"<a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/javascript/\">See our JavaScript documentation for more information.</a>"}]},{"id":"modaloptions","type":"heading","en":"<code>.modal(options)</code>","level":4},{"id":"modaloptions--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Activates your content as a modal. Accepts an optional options <code>object</code>."},{"id":"modaloptions--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').modal({\n  keyboard: false\n})","language":"js"},{"id":"modaltoggle","type":"heading","en":"<code>.modal(&#39;toggle&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"modaltoggle--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Manually toggles a modal. <strong>Returns to the caller before the modal has actually been shown or hidden</strong> (i.e. before the <code>shown.bs.modal</code> or <code>hidden.bs.modal</code> event occurs)."},{"id":"modaltoggle--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').modal('toggle')","language":"js"},{"id":"modalshow","type":"heading","en":"<code>.modal(&#39;show&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"modalshow--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Manually opens a modal. <strong>Returns to the caller before the modal has actually been shown</strong> (i.e. before the <code>shown.bs.modal</code> event occurs)."},{"id":"modalshow--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').modal('show')","language":"js"},{"id":"modalhide","type":"heading","en":"<code>.modal(&#39;hide&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"modalhide--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Manually hides a modal. <strong>Returns to the caller before the modal has actually been hidden</strong> (i.e. before the <code>hidden.bs.modal</code> event occurs)."},{"id":"modalhide--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').modal('hide')","language":"js"},{"id":"modalhandleupdate","type":"heading","en":"<code>.modal(&#39;handleUpdate&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"modalhandleupdate--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Manually readjust the modal’s position if the height of a modal changes while it is open (i.e. in case a scrollbar appears)."},{"id":"modalhandleupdate--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').modal('handleUpdate')","language":"js"},{"id":"modaldispose","type":"heading","en":"<code>.modal(&#39;dispose&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"modaldispose--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Destroys an element’s modal."},{"id":"events","type":"heading","en":"Events","level":3},{"id":"events--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap’s modal class exposes a few events for hooking into modal functionality. All modal events are fired at the modal itself (i.e. at the <code>&lt;div class=&quot;modal&quot;&gt;</code>)."},{"id":"events--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Event Type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"show.bs.modal"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"This event fires immediately when the <code>show</code> instance method is called. If caused by a click, the clicked element is available as the <code>relatedTarget</code> property of the event."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"shown.bs.modal"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"This event is fired when the modal has been made visible to the user (will wait for CSS transitions to complete). If caused by a click, the clicked element is available as the <code>relatedTarget</code> property of the event."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"hide.bs.modal"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"This event is fired immediately when the <code>hide</code> instance method has been called."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"hidden.bs.modal"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"This event is fired when the modal has finished being hidden from the user (will wait for CSS transitions to complete)."}]}]}]},{"id":"events--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myModal').on('hidden.bs.modal', function (e) {\n  // do something...\n})","language":"js"}],"demos":[{"key":"d452bb87ea9461b139bf","html":"\n  <div class=\"modal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\">\n    <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n      <div class=\"modal-content\">\n        <div class=\"modal-header\">\n          <h5 class=\"modal-title\">Modal title</h5>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">×</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"modal-body\">\n          <p>Modal body text goes here.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save changes</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-modal"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fc75cd4dd641822ee131","html":"\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModalLive\">\n    Launch demo modal\n  </button>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7ca0430614c6d35f0fe0","html":"\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModalLong\">\n    Launch demo modal\n  </button>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fb7d9e8f69c92527e237","html":"\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModalCenter\">\n    Launch demo modal\n  </button>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d39810786bc08db3551a","html":"\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModalPopovers\">\n    Launch demo modal\n  </button>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"15ab0bd4404c12df21ca","html":"\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#gridSystemModal\">\n  Launch demo modal\n</button>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"3d6ec5030f79dd14d9ce","html":"\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModal\" data-whatever=\"@mdo\">Open modal for @mdo</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModal\" data-whatever=\"@fat\">Open modal for @fat</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#exampleModal\" data-whatever=\"@getbootstrap\">Open modal for @getbootstrap</button>\n\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"exampleModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"exampleModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h5 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"exampleModalLabel\">New message</h5>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">×</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <form>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"recipient-name\" class=\"col-form-label\">Recipient:</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"recipient-name\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"message-text\" class=\"col-form-label\">Message:</label>\n            <textarea class=\"form-control\" id=\"message-text\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Send message</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"036c830f29cc7188d37d","html":"\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\".bd-example-modal-lg\">Large modal</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\".bd-example-modal-sm\">Small modal</button>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/layout/grid/"},{"en":"Media object","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/layout/media-object/"},{"en":"Utilities for layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/layout/utilities-for-layout/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Reboot","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Typography","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/content/typography/"},{"en":"Code","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/content/code/"},{"en":"Images","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/content/images/"},{"en":"Tables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/content/tables/"},{"en":"Figures","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/content/figures/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Alerts","h